    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "vil = want",
     "texto": [
      "**vil** + infinitive = want: Jeg **vil** have solskin.\n\nThe stronger you say it, the more determined you sound: Jeg **VIL** ikke nordpå!\n\nSaid softly, it almost means the future: Hvis du tager sydpå, så **vil** jeg tage til Norge (… I'll go to Norway)."
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    },
