     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formal letter",
     "texto": [
      "In letters to companies you don't write «Dear Sir»: you start straight away. You end with **Med venlig hilsen** (Yours faithfully).\n\nBetween friends: **Kære** Lotte, … **Kærlig hilsen** / **Mange kærlige hilsener**. Less personal: **Hjertelig hilsen**, **De bedste hilsener**."
